# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 1: METADATA BLOCK
# ( Identity, Provenance, VCS Exclusion Contracts & System Anchors )
# ==============================================================================
# @project       Tenebris and Lux
# @file          .gitignore
# @layer         Version Control & Workspace Hygiene
# @version       0.0.1
# @interface_rev Rev 2
# @date          2026-10-26
# @updated       2026-10-26
# @author        CreativeWorkzStudio LLC / ProfessorSeanEX
# @repository    https://github.com/Novaking34/tenebris-lux
#
# PURPOSE & ARCHITECTURAL ROLE:
#   Repository version control exclusion manifest and root hygiene guard.
#   Guarantees that intermediate build artifacts, machine-specific binaries,
#   IDE workspace states, diagnostic dumps, and OS cache detritus never
#   pollute the Git history or corrupt cross-platform verification trees.
#
# PEDAGOGICAL MISSION:
#   Maintains an immaculate, reproducible repository state across Unix,
#   Linux, and Windows environments, ensuring new contributors and automated
#   agents operate exclusively on canonical, unpolluted source code.
#
# AXIOMATIC INVARIANTS:
#   1. Zero binary tracking: Never commit machine-generated object code.
#   2. Zero CMake cache leakage: Toolchain paths remain strictly local.
#   3. Zero user-environment leakage: IDE and editor caches stay untracked.
#   4. Strict 80-column line width discipline across comments and rules.
# ==============================================================================

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 2: OPENING / COMPILED BINARIES BLOCK
# ( Native Executables, Object Files & Dynamic Libraries )
# Stratum: Version Control | Machine: vcs.hygiene.binaries
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [ SUB-ASSEMBLY 2.1: INTERMEDIATE OBJECT FILES & ARCHIVES ]
# Mission: Insulate repo from platform-dependent object code and libraries.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Intermediate compiler object code (ELF, Mach-O, PE/COFF)
*.o
*.obj

# Static library archives
*.a
*.lib

# Dynamic shared libraries and shared objects
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Native executables and application bundles
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Distribution directories and target output staging
bin/
out/
dist/
target/
tools/target/

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 3: BODY / BUILD SYSTEM ARTIFACTS BLOCK
# ( CMake Caches, Generated Build Files & Toolchain Temporary Files )
# Stratum: Version Control | Machine: vcs.hygiene.cmake
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [ SUB-ASSEMBLY 3.1: CMAKE BUILD DIRECTORIES & CACHES ]
# Mission: Exclude generated build trees and toolchain configuration state.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Primary out-of-source CMake build directories
build/
build-*/

# Root CMake cache files generated during in-source configurations
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile

# CTest test driver files and testing reports
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/

# Compiler commands database (exported for local LSP engines)
compile_commands.json

# CMake installation manifests and external dependency caches
install_manifest.txt
_deps/

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 4: AUDIT PROCEDURES / LOGS & TELEMETRY BLOCK
# ( Diagnostic Dumps, Crash Reports, Trace Records & Audit Outputs )
# Stratum: Version Control | Machine: vcs.hygiene.telemetry
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [ SUB-ASSEMBLY 4.1: DIAGNOSTIC LOGS & SCRATCH DIRECTORIES ]
# Mission: Prevent transient runtime traces and scratch files from commit.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Engine diagnostic runtime traces and crash logs
*.log
*.audit
logs/

# Temporary scratch and experiment worktrees
scratch/
test_output/

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 5: CLOSING / IDE & OS SPECIFIC METADATA BLOCK
# ( Editor Workspaces, Language Server Indices & OS Detritus )
# Stratum: Version Control | Machine: vcs.hygiene.workspaces
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [ SUB-ASSEMBLY 5.1: EDITOR SETTINGS & LANGUAGE SERVER CACHES ]
# Mission: Guard repository from developer-specific editor configurations.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# IDE workspace folders and metadata
.vscode/
.idea/
.cache/

# Vim / Emacs swap files and lock buffers
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.#*

# Operating system desktop database files and thumbnail caches
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# End of .gitignore
